<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Healthcare COMPARE Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Healthcare COMPARE Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson-Humphrey said it upgraded Healthcare COMPARE Corp to near-term buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- said kept Healthcare COMPARE's long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Healthcare COMPARE remained unchanged at 41.</p>
</text>
